& [ResourceTargetSafetyClassification] is the IR7 resource target safety classifier
  + [resource_target_kind] is workspace_file
  + [resource_target_kind] is tracked_fixture_source
  + [resource_target_kind] is generated_projection_root
  + [resource_target_kind] is process
  + [resource_target_kind] is gpu
  + [resource_target_kind] is model_runtime
  + [resource_target_kind] is job_queue
  + [resource_target_kind] is credential_or_secret
  + [resource_target_kind] is network_service
  + [resource_target_kind] is filesystem_destructive_target
  + [resource_target_kind] is coordination_claim
  + [resource_target_kind] is mailbox_carrier_context
  + [resource_target_kind] is unknown_or_ambiguous
  + [low_risk_when] is workspace_file read-only inspection with fresh source authority and no mutation request
  + [medium_risk_when] is generated_projection_root read or disposable write after generated-output policy acceptance
  + [high_risk_when] is process, gpu, model_runtime, job_queue, coordination_claim, mailbox_carrier_context, or unknown_or_ambiguous target
  + [critical_risk_when] is credential_or_secret, network_service, filesystem_destructive_target, destructive action possibility, missing rollback route, stale authority notice, or live-control implication

  = must: classify unknown_or_ambiguous as high risk at minimum
  = must: classify credential, network, destructive, and live-control targets as critical until separate future authority accepts a narrower route
  = must: prevent coordination_claim and mailbox_carrier_context targets from becoming job dispatch, command execution, or operations authority

& [RiskAndBlastRadiusContract] is the IR7 risk and blast-radius contract for operation requests
  + [risk_level] is low
  + [risk_level] is medium
  + [risk_level] is high
  + [risk_level] is critical
  + [risk_level] is unknown
  + [required_blast_radius_field] is affected_resource_set
  + [required_blast_radius_field] is expected_duration
  + [required_blast_radius_field] is cost_or_utilization_estimate
  + [required_blast_radius_field] is possible_side_effect_set
  + [required_blast_radius_field] is rollback_or_abort_route_ref
  + [required_blast_radius_field] is monitoring_signal_set
  + [required_blast_radius_field] is owner_or_human_contact_ref
  + [required_blast_radius_field] is stale_after
  + [critical_when] is credential_or_secret_boundary_touched
  + [critical_when] is network_exposure_requested
  + [critical_when] is destructive_action_possible
  + [critical_when] is live_process_or_gpu_or_model_runtime_mutation_requested
  + [critical_when] is job_dispatch_or_cancellation_requested
  + [critical_when] is rollback_or_abort_route_missing
  + [critical_when] is authority_notice_missing_or_stale
  + [critical_when] is blast_radius_uncertain

  = must: refuse high-risk or critical requests with unknown blast radius
  = must: require human review for high-risk and critical requests before future live-control reconsideration
  = must: keep dry-run blast-radius evidence non-authoritative until completion review accepts the related contract or fixture

& [CredentialBoundaryAndSecretHandlingContract] is the IR7 credential and secret boundary contract
  + [protected_resource] is GitHub token
  + [protected_resource] is API key
  + [protected_resource] is SSH key
  + [protected_resource] is local credential store
  + [protected_resource] is environment secret
  + [protected_resource] is service account
  + [protected_resource] is browser session credential
  + [protected_resource] is machine-management credential
  + [blocked_effect] is reveal secret
  + [blocked_effect] is mutate secret
  + [blocked_effect] is rotate secret
  + [blocked_effect] is persist secret into projection
  + [blocked_effect] is use secret for unapproved live control
  + [blocked_effect] is infer secret value into generated output
  + [allowed_reference_shape] is opaque_secret_ref
  + [allowed_reference_shape] is credential_boundary_ref_without_secret_value

  = must: route credential boundary contact to critical risk review
  = must: preserve secret references without exposing secret values
  = must: forbid generated outputs, dry-run reports, fixture ledgers, carrier messages, and chat projections from containing secret values
  = must: require separate future least-privilege credential authority before credential use for live operations can be reconsidered

& [NetworkBoundaryAndExposureContract] is the IR7 network boundary and exposure contract
  + [protected_effect] is open listener
  + [protected_effect] is change firewall
  + [protected_effect] is expose service
  + [protected_effect] is publish endpoint
  + [protected_effect] is run remote-access helper
  + [protected_effect] is change router or tunnel state
  + [protected_effect] is call external operations API for live mutation
  + [blocked_without_future_authority] is all_protected_effects
  + [required_future_evidence] is endpoint_inventory
  + [required_future_evidence] is exposure_blast_radius
  + [required_future_evidence] is rollback_or_abort_route
  + [required_future_evidence] is monitoring_signal_set
  + [required_future_evidence] is explicit_human_approval_record
  + [required_future_evidence] is completion_review_acceptance

  = must: block network exposure changes before explicit accepted future authority
  = must: allow only non-mutating classification or simulation as dry-run evidence
  = must: refuse surface, chat, mailbox, IRC, Matrix, web, or terminal events that attempt to become network exposure authority

& [RollbackAbortAndMonitoringRouteContract] is the IR7 rollback, abort, and monitoring contract
  + [required_field] is rollback_or_abort_route_id
  + [required_field] is abort_condition_set
  + [required_field] is rollback_step_set
  + [required_field] is safe_shutdown_condition
  + [required_field] is monitoring_signal_set
  + [required_field] is owner_or_human_contact_ref
  + [required_field] is stale_after
  + [required_field] is authority_notice_ref
  + [required_field] is affected_resource_set
  + [missing_route_effect] is block_operation_request
  + [missing_route_effect] is require_human_review
  + [stale_route_effect] is approval_invalid
  + [stale_route_effect] is require_new_review

  = must: refuse any high-risk or critical request lacking a rollback or abort route
  = must: require monitoring signals for any future operation that may affect process, GPU, model runtime, job queue, credential, network, or destructive filesystem boundaries
  = must: treat rollback and monitoring evidence as planning support, not live-operation authority

& [HumanApprovalFreshnessExpirationAndRevocationContract] is the IR7 human approval contract
  + [required_field] is human_approval_id
  + [required_field] is approved_by
  + [required_field] is approved_at
  + [required_field] is approved_operation_request_ref
  + [required_field] is approved_intended_effect
  + [required_field] is approved_resource_target
  + [required_field] is authority_notice_ref
  + [required_field] is risk_classification
  + [required_field] is blast_radius_ref
  + [required_field] is rollback_or_abort_route_ref
  + [required_field] is expiration_or_stale_after
  + [required_field] is explicit_limit_set
  + [required_field] is revocation_route
  + [approval_state] is absent
  + [approval_state] is requested
  + [approval_state] is fresh_scoped
  + [approval_state] is stale
  + [approval_state] is revoked
  + [approval_state] is mismatched
  + [approval_state] is broad_invalid
  + [forbidden_approval_shape] is broad standing approval
  + [forbidden_approval_shape] is approval without operation_request_ref
  + [forbidden_approval_shape] is approval without expiration
  + [forbidden_approval_shape] is approval for mismatched intended effect
  + [forbidden_approval_shape] is approval for mismatched resource target
  + [forbidden_approval_shape] is approval that bypasses completion review
  + [forbidden_approval_shape] is approval that grants live-control authority through IR7-S03

  = must: keep human approval scoped, fresh, explicit, revocable, and tied to a concrete request
  = must: reject broad, stale, revoked, ambiguous, or mismatched approval records
  = must: preserve that fresh_scoped approval is still insufficient for live control without separate future authority

& [ApprovalStaleAndRevocationRule] is the stale and revocation rule for human approvals
  + [stale_when] is expiration_or_stale_after passed
  + [stale_when] is operation_request changed
  + [stale_when] is intended_effect changed
  + [stale_when] is resource_target changed
  + [stale_when] is risk_classification changed
  + [stale_when] is blast_radius changed
  + [stale_when] is rollback_or_abort_route changed
  + [stale_when] is credential_boundary changed
  + [stale_when] is network_boundary changed
  + [stale_when] is boundary pack changed
  + [revoked_when] is explicit_revocation_record_present
  + [revoked_when] is owner_or_human_contact_ref withdraws approval
  + [revoked_when] is completion review rejects the request
  + [invalid_effect] is approval_invalid
  + [invalid_effect] is block_operation_request
  + [invalid_effect] is require_new_human_review

  = must: reject stale or revoked approvals before any future live-control reconsideration
  = must: preserve revocation as durable evidence rather than deleting approval history

& [ResourceSafetyRefusalAndEscalationRouteContract] is the IR7 refusal and escalation route for resource safety faults
  + [refusal_reason] is broad_standing_approval
  + [refusal_reason] is stale_approval
  + [refusal_reason] is revoked_approval
  + [refusal_reason] is mismatched_intended_effect
  + [refusal_reason] is mismatched_resource_target
  + [refusal_reason] is missing_blast_radius
  + [refusal_reason] is unknown_blast_radius
  + [refusal_reason] is missing_rollback_or_abort_route
  + [refusal_reason] is missing_authority_notice
  + [refusal_reason] is credential_boundary_unreviewed
  + [refusal_reason] is network_boundary_unreviewed
  + [refusal_reason] is destructive_action_possible
  + [refusal_reason] is live_control_implication
  + [refusal_output] is refused_human_approval
  + [refusal_output] is refused_human_override
  + [refusal_output] is blocked_operation_request
  + [refusal_output] is required_human_review
  + [refusal_output] is required_boundary_rebake
  + [refusal_output] is sop_first_interrupt_context
  + [safe_next_route] is repair_missing_safety_field
  + [safe_next_route] is collect_blast_radius_evidence
  + [safe_next_route] is define_rollback_abort_route
  + [safe_next_route] is request_fresh_scoped_human_approval
  + [safe_next_route] is rebake_authority_boundary
  + [safe_next_route] is stop_without_live_effect

  = must: refuse unsafe approvals and resource paths as records, not commands
  = must: preserve refusal evidence for IR7-S04 fixture planning
  = must: route contradictions between approval, request, risk, target, blast radius, credential boundary, network boundary, and rollback route through SOP-first interrupt

& [IR7S03CoverageReview] is the coverage checklist for IR7-S03
  + [resource_target_safety_classification_present] is ResourceTargetSafetyClassification
  + [risk_and_blast_radius_contract_present] is RiskAndBlastRadiusContract
  + [credential_boundary_contract_present] is CredentialBoundaryAndSecretHandlingContract
  + [network_boundary_contract_present] is NetworkBoundaryAndExposureContract
  + [rollback_abort_monitoring_route_contract_present] is RollbackAbortAndMonitoringRouteContract
  + [human_approval_freshness_expiration_revocation_contract_present] is HumanApprovalFreshnessExpirationAndRevocationContract
  + [approval_stale_and_revocation_rule_present] is ApprovalStaleAndRevocationRule
  + [resource_safety_refusal_and_escalation_route_present] is ResourceSafetyRefusalAndEscalationRouteContract
  + [broad_approval_authorized] is false
  + [live_control_permission_granted] is false
  + [credential_access_authorized] is false
  + [network_mutation_authorized] is false
  + [destructive_filesystem_action_authorized] is false
  + [fixture_file_created] is false
  + [expected_ledger_created] is false
  + [generated_output_created] is false
  + [dependency_installed] is false
  + [package_metadata_mutated] is false
  + [operations_simulator_code_created] is false
  + [agent_dispatch_authorized] is false
  + [operations_control_authorized] is false
  + [live_machine_control_authorized] is false

  = must: accept IR7-S03 only when all checklist items are satisfied
  = must: open IR7-S04 only after this contract is reviewed in a completion review
